# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout for every platform.
# Without this, Windows checks out text files as CRLF (core.autocrlf), which
# breaks the headless smoke's byte-exact source assertions (e.g. the
# pasteNormalize body pin) that compare against LF control strings — the suite
# passes on Linux but fails on the windows-latest CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.msi binary
*.exe binary
